    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>We Love Fish Tanks</i> \u2013 a cozy and relaxing sandbox where you can build the aquarium of your dreams. Create, grow, and collect at your own pace with no stress, no consequences, no manipulative game mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Tanks:</strong> Choose from a variety of backgrounds, wall styles, water colors, and lighting options to design up to 9 fish tanks that are uniquely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish of All Sizes:</strong> Stock your aquarium with fish of different sizes to create a lively and dynamic underwater world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Limits on Fish:</strong> Add as many fish as you want to your tanks\u2014your only limit is how much your computer can handle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover and Collect:</strong> Breed fish to unlock unique colors and personalities, building a vibrant and curated collection of aquatic life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Fun:</strong> With no  losing conditions, and no manipulative game mechanics, the game is all about nurturing your fish, chilling out, and watching your creations flourish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a collector, decorator, or simply someone who loves fish, <i>We Love Fish Tanks</i> is the perfect way to relax and create your own aquatic paradise. Start your journey today and see where your imagination takes you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For my Pookie Bear &lt;3</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>We Love Fish Tanks</i> \u2013 a cozy and relaxing sandbox where you can build the aquarium of your dreams. Create, grow, and collect at your own pace with no stress, no consequences, no manipulative game mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Tanks:</strong> Choose from a variety of backgrounds, wall styles, water colors, and lighting options to design up to 9 fish tanks that are uniquely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish of All Sizes:</strong> Stock your aquarium with fish of different sizes to create a lively and dynamic underwater world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Limits on Fish:</strong> Add as many fish as you want to your tanks\u2014your only limit is how much your computer can handle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover and Collect:</strong> Breed fish to unlock unique colors and personalities, building a vibrant and curated collection of aquatic life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stress-Free Fun:</strong> With no  losing conditions, and no manipulative game mechanics, the game is all about nurturing your fish, chilling out, and watching your creations flourish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a collector, decorator, or simply someone who loves fish, <i>We Love Fish Tanks</i> is the perfect way to relax and create your own aquatic paradise. Start your journey today and see where your imagination takes you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For my Pookie Bear &lt;3</p>",
    "short_description": "We Love Fish Tanks is a cozy aquarium builder. Kick back &amp; relax, buy, breed, &amp; sell fish (or fish-like things), and decorate your tank exactly how you'd like!",
